    "Projected sub-micrometre DXF Z residuals to the drawing plane",
    "Preserved OCS mirroring, circular holes, arcs, bulges and cutouts",
    "Registered side profiles 2 mm outward with preview spacers for gantry-end clearance; rear profile 5 mm outward between source front grill and housing",
